# worldclock golden — the Rust drawer's own output, frozen
# 2026-09-27n and then DELETED. The scene is the only painter now;
# these rows are the parity record the drawer used to be compared
# against, so an engine change that moves a command or a click
# region shows up here as one changed line.
#
# The command rows are the drawer's verbatim. The `#` region rows
# are the SCENE's hits — the 480-case differential proved the two
# equal on the run before the body was deleted, and the body had
# only three `region()` calls for them.
#
# Regenerating is a deliberate act: there is no generator any more
# (it needed the drawer). Hand-edit with the same care, or port the
# card back before changing what it paints.
